# (category entity) A minecart rolling over a detector rail gives a pulse of exactly 20 gt,
# whatever its speed: the rail turns on when the cart's box enters it (entityInside ->
# checkPressed) and schedules its re-check 20 gt later (DetectorRailBlock.PRESSED_CHECK_PERIOD),
# which finds the cart gone. The cart then stops against the wall at exactly 9 - 0.49 (its float
# half-width): a block stop is exact, an unpowered powered rail stops a cart wherever its speed
# runs out.
design designs/gadgets/entity-rail-pass.txt
probe d 4 1 0
settle
use 1 1 1
expect_trace d 00000000000
expect_trace d 11111111111111111111
expect_trace d 0
settle 200
expect_entity minecart 8.51 1.0625 0.5
expect_entities 1
